1evj|n|In the most general sense, any one of the Quadrumana, including apes, baboons, and lemurs. ; Any species of Quadrumana, except the lemurs. ; Any one of numerous species of Quadrumana (esp. such as have a long tail and prehensile feet) exclusive of apes and baboons. ; A term of disapproval, ridicule, or contempt, as for a mischievous child. ; The weight or hammer of a pile driver, that is, a very heavy mass of iron, which, being raised on high, falls on the head of the pile, and drives it into the earth; the falling weight of a drop hammer used in forging. ; A small trading vessel of the sixteenth century.	a:26ky,62,2~26ky,62,2	v:er0,58,1;1cnq,40,1~1cnq,40,1;er0,58,1	n:1cnq,60,4;20ez,47,2;eq9,43,5~eq9,43,5;1cnq,60,4;20ez,47,2
